    "body": "Manual GUI test passed on 2026-11-21 at head `2e8be791db2a9fe02e8da7055e5989d53f97dce6`.\n\nI tested the `O4 Cam Plate master` project with a 2D Contour:\n- Entry type: Plunge\n- Lead in/out: None\n- Lead out type: None\n- Before lead-in: 0.0 mm\n- After lead-out: 0.0 mm\n- Overlap past the start: 0.0 mm\n\nThe generated viewport path has no lead-in at the contour seam. The cut starts directly on the contour.\r\n",
