    "body": "Manual regression test passed on 2026-11-21 at head `2e8be791db2a9fe02e8da7055e5989d53f97dce6`.\n\nOn `O4 Cam Plate master`, I tested Entry type Plunge and Arc. With Lead in/out None, Lead out None, and zero extensions/overlap, the seam had no lead-in and the cut started directly on the contour.\n\nI also changed Lead in/out from Linear to Arc and back to None. Each selected lead shape appeared only while selected; None removed the lead each time.\r\n",
